{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>CutCompanion 是一款結合對話式教練的營養管理 App，會把身體組成目標、活動量與飲食偏好整理成可自行編輯的熱量與營養素計劃，並以文字或相片記錄餐點、追蹤體重與活動數據。適合想有系統地控制飲食、又不想每次自行計算營養數值的人士。原價 US $0.99，目前<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n\n\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-24.webp\"/></figure>\n\n\n<h2>把營養計劃變成每日習慣</h2>\n\n\n<p>首次使用時，對話式引導會按身體組成目標、活動量與飲食偏好，生成可自行修改的熱量及營養素計劃。記錄餐點可輸入文字、上載相片或兩者並用，儲存前先核對 AI 估算的營養數值。每日目標涵蓋熱量、蛋白質、碳水化合物與脂肪，並可追蹤體重趨勢，Apple Health 亦會同步步數與運動分鐘。</p>\n\n\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-275-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-276-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-277-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-278-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-279-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-280-scaled.jpg\"/></figure></figure>\n\n\n<ul><li>應用名稱：CutCompanion</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/cutcompanion/id6762249975?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:46.017670+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":349,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:22:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.635100+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.635100+00:00","content_hash":"dbb77acdb9f8af2121c8dd1be792d5d19e2e4767ae4beeb36f0d87c6910db784","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}